+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. It was chosen because it is memory-hard and resists GPU-based brute-force attacks as well as side-channel attacks. No specific parameters (memory cost, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
